    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Assets marked Terminated mid-contract where no corresponding credit memo or refund exists.
Why it matters: The customer terminated service but you&apos;re still billing — or you owe them a credit you haven&apos;t issued. Either way, customer satisfaction risk plus AR/revenue misstatement.
Suppress a finding: when the termination is contractually no-credit (e.g. customer breach).
Disable the detector: only if your org doesn&apos;t track assets. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
